{1097}{ Fragile bones

Description : You are suffering from a terrible disease. Your bones are very fragile .Therefore you lose 50 % of your hit points .To compensate for this and just to stay alive you have run all your life and thrown rocks to your enemies. You get a speed increase of  +6 and also 6 ranks in the throw skill. You start with 600 gold}

{1098}{ Dimensional traveler.

(By Loko)Arcanum is most certainly not your home. The mysterious experiments that brought you here have proven too difficult to repeat, and so you resolve to find a new life in this place. Your scientific past gives you  +4 to intelligence and +4 perception. On the other hand, Arcanum's strange culture and attitudes give you -6 to charisma and , and -35 to reaction (You look...very odd, somehow).You don't have any local money but you start with a weapon and some bullets.}

{1099}{Tragic Doctor

You have been trained as a doctor. You get a huge bonus 12/4 in healing and 4 points in intelligence .You also get a  bonus of 30 expertise in therapeutics and a bonus of 30 expertise in herbal sciences. Unfortunately one of your patients has died by your mistake. He was your only son. Your  personality suffers tremendously willpower drops to 2 and can never go higher. You also get more critical failures in combat +20.You have donated all your money to the poor so you start with nothing.}

{1100}{Mule

You could  always carry more than other people of the same strength (+2000).But your speed is reduced by one. You start with 600 gold}

{1101}{Dark Knight

 (By Zed) You joined a cult called the Dark Knights. You gain +1 strength and +1 dexterity, but you loose all starting wealth, and suffer a  negative reputation of -35 }

{1102}{Negotiator

(By Zed)You are very skilled, in  language,. You gain a huge bonus to persuasion  6/4  and also a little bonus to Haggle 2/4 , and by selling many books, you start with double wealth (1200 coin). The bad thing is because you talk so much with people you don't have time for everybody. Therefore you can have one less maximum follower.}

{1103}{Monster

You are a monster or so everybody thinks .Your body is totally deformed by a birth accident. Your beauty is only 1 and can never go higher .When you were born  your mother died and you were left in the woods to die. Since you did not talked to anybody alive until you were 10 years old you suffered from a total lack of human relationship. Your charisma is 1 and can never go higher .You can only have one  follower. But while the living didn't want to talk to you, you  found company with the spirits of the dead .They showed you things that a normal mortal could not know and that gives you a major advantage of +4 in intelligence. The hardships of life have made you much stronger .You receive a major boost +4 in strength. Your melee and dodge skills also receive a substantial bonus +4/4.You start with no money .}

{1104}{Ex Angel

Because of your love for a beautiful elf you have ask god to make you a mortal elf. But only 100 years after you were married your loved one was killed by an accident. After a period of mourning you asked your god for a chance to become immortal again. A ticket for the Zephyr airship magically appeared in your pocket. As an ex angel you start with a substantial bonus of +4 to both charisma and beauty. You also have a bigger chance of critical hits .(+10 %).  But because everything you have experienced as a mortal you have in the past experienced as an Angel you seem to get only half the experience points that normal mortals would get. You start with 600 gold.}

{1105}{Woken in a cemetery 

You have woken up in a cemetery. You feel something is very wrong. You are terribly deformed.(minus 6 to beauty).You don't remember anything from your past but for some reason you sense a heavy burden on your consciousness. You have a huge  tattoo in your chest. The tattoo seems to contain words in an unknown language. For reasons unknown you possess an unnaturally high resistance to normal damage +25 % to normal damage. With the last money in your pocket you buy a ticket to Arcanum biggest city hoping to find clues for your past, so you start with no money at all. }

{1106}{ Vampire hunter 

A vampire murdered your parents. You have dedicated your life to hunt and destroy those undead creatures. You gain +50 % to magick resistance ,25 % to fire resistance +1 to strength +4 perception and 3/4 to prowling. However you lose 4 points in charisma and because of the heavy equipment you need to carry in order to destroy vampires you can carry 3000 units less. You start with no money having spend all your money in your crusade against vampires.}

{1107}{ Dark Vampire 

Your father abused you both sexually and physically .You tried to escape but he caught you and almost killed you.(-6 to constitution).In your desperation you visited an evil witch .. She brought you in touch with an ancient human that possessed  a dark soul .He told you that he would help you but before that,  you should bring him food for him and his friends to feast for 10 times. You  brought  him 10 small children. Finally he said to you .Drink some of  my blood and become one of us. Afterwards you felt an incredible strength +6 and you feel you are invulnerable +25 % damage resistance. You confronted your father and you will never forget the look in his face when you overpowered him and drunk his blood. Afterwards you swore that all mortals will be your food ( permanently -100 in alignment).Because killings seems so easy and natural for you, you seem to loose 1/3 of your gained exp. You start with 600 gold.} 

{1108}{ Gypsy 

You have lived your whole life outside of town living a nomadic life. Your gypsy traditions give you a bonus to magick aptitude of 20 % and a big bonus of 3/4 in haggle and 3/4 to persuasion. You are smarter compared to others having a bonus of +1 in intelligence. However because of your preference of living  alone you can have one less follower compared to others. Also as a gypsy you get a negative reaction of 20 from everybody else because people  believe that gypsies cannot be trusted and view them with suspicion. You start with zero gold.} 

{1109}{ Hell Demon 

You have traveled from hell to come in the land of the living .You have an inhuman strength +6 and an inhuman dexterity +6 . You also have a huge bonus to killing by melee combat+8/4 to dodge +8/4 to melee. You can also use your dark will to persuade people to do your bidding +2 charisma. But when you passed through hell to the land of the living the all father himself cursed you .As a result of the all father curse you suffer a penalty of 2/3 in your experience points and you also lose 1/3 of your fatigue points. Your alignment is always -100.Since there is no gold in Hell you start with no money whatsoever.} 

{1110}{ Popular 

You love people and they love you in return. You are able to attract one more follower than your charisma would allow .Because of your social ability you have never in you life been forced to fight. You suffer a disadvantage of 2/4 in all combat skills and  a penalty of 2 in willpower because everything was easy for you .You also suffer 10 % more critical failures. You start with 1200 gold. }

{1111}{Merchant 

Your father was a merchant your grandfather was a merchant. So you became a merchant yourself. You get a huge bonus to gamble 3/4 , haggle 3/4,persuasion 3/4 and a little one to intelligence +1 and charisma +1.But because you have never went adventuring you suffer a penalty of 2 in speed and 2 in strength. You start with 600 gold }

{1112}{Holy paladin 

You are a holy paladin sworn to battle evil until your last breath. As a paladin you have a natural bonus to your charisma +1,to your strength  +1and a big bonus to  persuasion 3/4 and finally a  bonus to fire resistance +25 %. .However a battle has scarred you terribly and you suffer -4 to beauty. As a paladin you also suffer a terrible negative reaction for bad deeds (4 times the negative reaction that others would suffer).You also start with no money having donated all your money to the poor.} 

{1113}{Eye for Eye

You have watched helplessly  the murders of your parents by an evil gang, reputedly from Tarrant. Your father was beaten to death and your mother was raped repeatedly and then stabbed to death. You were severely beaten and left for dead. From the beating and the scars you suffer a -2 in beauty and a minus 2 in constitution. The only think that keeps you alive now is your determination to get revenge for your parents by exterminating all evil gangs in the world. You have trained yourself in ranged fighting .As a result you have a bonus of +3/4 in bow, +3/4 in throw. You have also trained yourself   in stealth fighting .You get a bonus of 3/4 prowling and a bonus of 3/4 to backstab. From your training in hit and run tactics you get a bonus of +1 in speed. You start with no money whatsoever determined to get revenge.} 

{1114}{Noble primitive

You were born in a primitive village.. Since you don't knows the ways of modern man and women you suffer a penalty of -6 in charisma. But you race has an unnatural beauty +4.  Your primitive lifestyle   also increases your strength by  +2.You start with no money whatsoever. }

{1115}{Robot

You are a creature made by a scientist that could not have  children. You are very well made having a superhuman  +4 perception, +4 to strength ,and a bonus of +4 to intelligence. You also have +40 to technical aptitude. But as you are made from iron inside you are very slow. You suffer a penalty of  minus 4 to speed. You also suffer a penalty of  minus 4 to constitution because you are a little rusty and a penalty of minus 4 to willpower because you don't seem to have a mind of your own. You also have difficulty throwing things because of the noise that your joints make minus 3/4 to throw. After your father died from natural age , you sold everything you had  and bought a ticket to the airship. You start with 600 gold.} 

